      "text": "DNS OWNERSHIP\n\nExternalDNS watches HTTPRoutes\nand Gateway.status.addresses.\nSyncs Cloudflare A + ownership TXT.\nApplication record is DNS-only.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "box-20",
      "originalText": "DNS OWNERSHIP\n\nExternalDNS watches HTTPRoutes\nand Gateway.status.addresses.\nSyncs Cloudflare A + ownership TXT.\nApplication record is DNS-only.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
